  "releaseNotes": "Version numbering now tracks the Umbraco.AI package version it targets (starting at 17.0.0), replacing the prior independent 1.x sequence. Upgraded to Umbraco CMS 17.5.1, Umbraco.AI 17.0.0, and @umbraco-ui/uui 1.18.1. AI provider failures are now classified into distinct, localized error messages (temporary/retryable, connectivity, authentication/configuration, unclassified) driven by AIProviderException.Category. Added Spanish, French, Danish, German, Norwegian, Swedish, Italian, Hindi, and Portuguese localizations alongside English.",
